{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本電視台節目《ニノさん》早前請來人氣占卜師由李，利用出生年月日計算出屬於你的生命靈魂數字，每個數字各自代表不同類型的性格特徵，亦可藉此分析未來的運勢，即睇生命靈魂數字的計算方法，測出你的隱藏性格！</p><p>👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p><figure><img alt=\"（《ニノさん》節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495279135254384640705689.jpeg/-LwUWDpKEcldbxqeaD9kaQmNcwOiYeMeHq69zB6uvcw\"/><figcaption>（《ニノさん》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【計算方法】將出生年月日的數字拆開並相加起來，直至總數變成個位數。如得出11、22、33則無須相加至個位數。例如：出生日期為1963年6月3日，將1+9+6+3+6+3=28，2+8 = 10，1+0 = 1，最後可得出「生命靈數」為「1」。</p><figure><img alt=\"（《ニノさん》節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278944224808960973826.jpeg/0WMhNj1Qip8EEmQIDok3GZd0t2MwRw6gThe-iU4Xvok\"/><figcaption>（《ニノさん》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>👇👇計算好之後即可了解自己的性格優勢！👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278734513803264217648.jpeg/n2AdU67j4thET7KShsomy2bugvs6e2uxZnrb02Z629M\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278736514617344851243.jpeg/dTOdS1TYVCcFHxxSTVG78ykMu_J6MQjIdVUHynVVB8o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278738792255488089125.jpeg/QwHlOf-z_Bg_uBW8Wm1-bFLtV0l2LtJOOgQeKDoEHig\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210312/447033713532866560682710.jpeg/KXtEm25J07T0qHdyh-TjXUkJ7enE8FDuzcAc-c3AHPk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278740801458176068125.jpeg/WIVCuYfJmnHr4lTdbWPqyTYOFhqV07Xf-rIQAPqyEAA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278743301394432036187.jpeg/8K567VfDfRyFlc5MGjePyJ-N6vpfiWuyibTLN4m0yzc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278745579032576897615.jpeg/NxB6YgtIZjI2prHio47MyRoGac9MO7sI3CW2JdwltiU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278747512737792643278.jpeg/81kWNFAafozuoOTTP8RN7CTj1Wlb7oWUKz9VkCs_VZA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278749500968960582073.jpeg/FA096VGR1q7MUTh76XdGri3uhSWMfX9pR2b3ckdm93I\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278751833133056675398.jpeg/XoITqpjHCK37uKVGCTy9Ia3Gkie9HUhRVnzZMVZ82TE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278754530201600872613.jpeg/S-0RO5AoRiPbrAeG3I4lpSE--6lkHMgH8r7-g_K-_oM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495287790607536128143827.jpeg/NLD31vlQR__Tf6DeOF_nSj6izx1y1KOxmEZY55hGWOc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278731460349952045619.jpeg/WwWrB-AjVWfA8QWBgsqOXNlIcb54Vg9FjhdBc44XQXM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278733767348224691372.jpeg/C8-7xspbIZvQC9YQdXr56R7KIZLpziRyXtxWuF7cVrg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278746195202048327046.jpeg/ql920HtrFqp96A2_XJyZ091HoLGyHc1R7HlSPOx5Ujw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210723/495278748493811712304957.jpeg/eZGbGiOi-vlS_pTBK3s6-862Q0jHCecg5AYuR-QGLkc\"/><p>同場加映：好嘢食先VS留返最後先食？一個習慣即知你感性定理性！</p><p>每個人的飲食習慣都不一樣，有人會選擇先吃喜歡的食物，也有人習慣將最愛的菜式留到最後才慢慢品嚐，你又屬於哪一派？早前，日本富士電視台節目「ノンストップ！」請來心理醫生，分析先吃、後吃或輪流吃各自代表的象徵意義，憑一個習慣就可以知道你屬於感性派定理性派？</p><p>【問題】當你吃飯時，如果見到最喜歡的食物，你會選擇先吃、後吃或輪流吃？</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613490773626880839152.jpeg/vY3ipJw_qYvwT_V4F66v3MYS_6__SQ3JxJbTsMSW07A\"/><p>👇👇🍜決定好即睇心理專家解構動作背後的隱藏性格！🍜👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613490773626880839152.jpeg/vY3ipJw_qYvwT_V4F66v3MYS_6__SQ3JxJbTsMSW07A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613902478249984931082.jpeg/e1SLMxaVuzI1Xo7dVc0G2peRr0Hvc58njT3-ZY09_mU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613904642641920346752.jpeg/AAVW_pioBbc4Zd3lC7jeHKHKv2IUaG14MDAKoDAwCqA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613907461345280931425.jpeg/MTqegGjOp1uhv2fhvsqWfP5NCaH88QqGrOErpKzhK6Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210312/447033713532866560682710.jpeg/KXtEm25J07T0qHdyh-TjXUkJ7enE8FDuzcAc-c3AHPk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613910196162560580179.jpeg/PipZemvq3LPGuUgsXdeeIBenLO7Ab9hfhjjPWoY4z1o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613912314417152956128.jpeg/Nq2visxklvu4_StIT9WcIeoOKmFzUOnFGhuoqhobqKo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210702/487613914566889472435619.jpeg/S-sPhWUDQTMjbRRC7v89LFksa1ityuLpAOrTKgDq0yo\"/><p>完整分析結果即睇全文：好嘢食先VS留返最後先食？日專家拆解一個習慣即知你感性定理性！</p><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-31T00:38:39.086631+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":593,"images":27,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}